      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customs duty assessment on the formal entry filed per W5239 (BOC e2m)
Frequency: Per customs entry assessment
Volume: ~40-50 payments processed annually
Owner: Tax Accountant
Participants: Import Coordinator, Partner Bank (AAB), Customs Broker
Source: workflow W5238 — Import Duties Excise Tax and 12 Percent VAT Payment Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5238_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5238_Lane1" name="Import Coordinator">
