      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved SAD gate-pass (W5239)
Frequency: Per cleared container batch
Volume: ~40-50 haulage coordination events annually
Owner: Freight Coordinator
Participants: Customs Broker, Drayage Carrier Dispatcher, DC Operations Supervisor (VS-04)
Source: workflow W5240 — Port Drayage Scheduling and Direct Container Delivery Mobilization</bpmn:documentation>
